にちは！VtuberとしてYoutubeで活動している夢咲いちかと申します。\n\nこの度は、「私自身」のファンアートの作成をお願いしたくリクエストを送らせていただきました。\n\n■必須\n1.Youtubeのサムネイルやアイコンなどに使用することがあります。\n2.納品方式は透過pngを希望しています。\n└背景有の場合は、背景つきと背景なしの2種類の納品をしていただければ幸いです。\n3.サムネイルに使用することが前提の為、腰上～バストアップくらいのイメージでいいのですが、髪の毛の毛先などの見切れがないようにしていただけると幸いです。\n\n■お願い\n4.デザイン・構成など全てお任せします！衣装も自由で構いません！\nコスプレさせようと、水着きせようと、そのままの衣装でも構いません。\nまた、髪型なども自由にしていただいて構いません！\n5.サイズ感の指定もございませんが、大きめに描いていただけると幸いです。\n\n■資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ce3D2kMIXBSI71nQo1pZiGpdgyWOrs09?usp=sharing\n\n■Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/Yumesaki_Ichika\n\n■Youtube\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UClfjJJJqBh9SL4cCgNHDPsg\n\nお忙しいとは思いますが、何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ukde0H/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f421d3a/uploads/origins/73e4e38a-cadb-4ec8-8c4a-f080765ef8bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7cf4fbf36993dd9ab5aae1808c35b2c3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f421d3a/uploads/origins/73e4e38a-cadb-4ec8-8c4a-f080765ef8bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7cf4fbf36993dd9ab5aae1808c35b2c3, https://si.imgix.net/9f421d3a/uploads/origins/73e4e38a-cadb-4ec8-8c4a-f080765ef8bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c08adf4b30e961845975b38d7c97820 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f421d3a/uploads/origins/73e4e38a-cadb-4ec8-8c4a-f080765ef8bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f3a9801a10e7152a4c40b3700559c6d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Once again, my name is Minato Ragi and I am a VTuber on YouTube.\nThank you for your appeal to skeb!\nThank you again for your time!\n\nI'm requesting you to illustrate me as a Vtuber!\nAs for the composition, I would like to leave it up to you, and would appreciate it if you could draw it freely.\n\nIntended use\nWe would be happy to use your illustration as a thumbnail for our Youtube stream and on various social networking sites.\n\n● Format\nWe would like to use them as thumbnails, etc.\nIf possible, it would be helpful if you could also deliver separate data for the background and characters (transparent background).\nPSD data would be greatly appreciated.\n\nThank you very much for your cooperation.\n\n----------\n\nminato ragi)\nTwitter : https://twitter.com/minato_ragi\nYouTube : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC68G7CKwETqspxyNeMb7FiA\n\nAge: 20s\nHeight: about 160cm\nGender: Female\nAppearance: Elf ears, teardrops, and a marimo cocoon\nPhysique: slender\nPersonality: Calm.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tDIAnWikV0AcyWAA9x2Gcf0mBNgiOsqu", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ukde0H/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea446b8d/uploads/origins/41a798f3-eafb-49c4-8d43-cc29301daf4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f09c05ab700662b23ad8a127c60906f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea446b8d/uploads/origins/41a798f3-eafb-49c4-8d43-cc29301daf4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f09c05ab700662b23ad8a127c60906f, https://si.imgix.net/ea446b8d/uploads/origins/41a798f3-eafb-49c4-8d43-cc29301daf4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=914806856dcb458d5c5c0214008c37a6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea446b8d/uploads/origins/41a798f3-eafb-49c4-8d43-cc29301daf4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e5f026969f41afeebb68e9957829ec2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thanks for the appeal!\nI need an illustration of our little girl that we usually use in a game called VRChat! She's an angel bunny girl!\nPose, composition, etc. will be left up to you.\nBest regards!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kS1Blc4xr2YrdLTCxQbP5Bmuow7vKKnT?usp=sharingp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}